<section class="bg-sandalwood px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl border-l-4 border-oxblood pl-6 sm:pl-10">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-oxblood sm:text-4xl">
      What we don't offer yet
    </h2>
    <p class="measure mt-5 text-lg text-ink">
      Kalika Nrityalay opened in July 2021. Bharatanatyam arangetram takes
      seven to ten years of training, so we have no arangetram graduates —
      and we won't pretend otherwise. What we do is build the foundation
      correctly: adavus, aramandi, hasta, and the theory underneath them,
      taught the way Binni was taught. If your daughter starts here at
      seven, she will be ready when the time comes.
    </p>
  </div>
